{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2647a9bed83deb257ff7879a4db1d599304f3a72b9f9d58c472c2af3f14b626a", "ja": "『アーク』でハードな日々を送る3人は、\n同じく招かれていた玲音と会う。彼女から、\n頂点を目指す身として、黒井社長の理念は\n誤りかと問われて動揺する3人。トップとは\n強く孤独な存在。それは確かなのだが……", "zh": "在“方舟”过着严苛生活的3人，\n见到了同样受邀前来的玲音。被她问及\n作为以顶点为目标之人，黑井社长的理念\n是否真的有错时，3人动摇了。顶点\n便是强大而孤独的存在。这固然没错，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "23c92f751ffe408e4bfe378cace347720a441493a545ca6bb8bf97c33402de9d", "ja": "（961プロの施設に通い始めてもう数日。\n3人も次第に慣れてきているみたいだ）", "zh": "（开始使用961事务所的设施已经好几天了。看来3人也逐渐习惯了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "a089387a92d80d315d8ddb8190068bb8563be61cfacc9683c9c4ce8e28e1d4f6", "ja": "ここのレッスン、すっごく大変だったの～。\nトレーナーさん、イジワルって思うな！", "zh": "这里的训练，真的特别辛苦呢～  \n我觉得教练真坏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5b31d558ee1a1a5d7261ba92efb8ddf19e7268226daf6c83bd074e8b5a97893a", "ja": "あのメニューの詰め込み具合はな……。\nこれからは自主練に切り替えればいいさ。", "zh": "那个训练项目的紧凑程度确实挺过分的……\n接下来只要切换成自主练习就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "f57b6ad5f442c2dc6e952814d2146b91755af96e3a8182c6be13fb595be76018", "ja": "私もさすがに堪えました。\nですが響は連日、ついていっていましたね。", "zh": "连我也着实吃不消。不过，响却连续好几天都跟了下来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "b552327751875992867a8ef70ae519bff6bb46168084011f98e0603beb61a4d3", "ja": "うん。体を追い込む系のレッスン、\n自分は結構好きだからね。", "zh": "嗯。逼迫自己身体极限的那种课程，\n其实自己还挺喜欢的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "1a1d56a730894bbf33ae4e73fdd3b9810ac61889b9c0a6d28284b539810a793e", "ja": "今日は、もうちょっとやってもいいかな……。", "zh": "今天，再多练一会儿也可以吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1006_202xxx", "source_sha256": "2e510b336fa83f190b2b2bea2e0c4c773cdf0bb94f72bce0ee1b8d0ddb554133", "ja": "やっぱり！\nアタシの見間違いじゃなかったみたいだね。", "zh": "果然！\n看来不是我看错了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "bae638f1716c2c2b1de22b412cfdba7cd8590cd46f8afcec4295d77cf945ce47", "ja": "え？　……ああっ、玲音！？", "zh": "诶？……啊！玲音！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1008_202xxx", "source_sha256": "b236c8ac693b2bc712dd7cf3d7692a82660b040ba3c91255b3b393981b2b6c07", "ja": "やあ、我那覇、{$P$}！\nこんなところで会うとは思わなかったな。", "zh": "嗨，我那霸、{$P$}！\n没想到会在这种地方遇到你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f9483a0c5988d3332b97ea5efae2c3263a18d9664f071868623e678551481b03", "ja": "お疲れさま、玲音。\nなんとなく、会える予感はしていたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，玲音。\n总觉得，我就预感到会见到你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1010_202xxx", "source_sha256": "588148ed5c6ffa083e0016383f9c28874eedb51e583b2baa262eaa7ece2d2aad", "ja": "へえ、それは嬉しいな。いいことが聞けた。\nまぁ、アタシもなんだけど！", "zh": "哦，那可真让人高兴。听到了好消息。\n不过嘛，我也是这么想的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1011_202xxx", "source_sha256": "2744ed0ef74a008d61528d5ae2768de3eae24e518b4ff5a710c31b81f83fd69a", "ja": "星井と四条は、ちょっと久しぶりかな？\nでも噂は聞いてるよ。活躍してるみたいじゃないか。", "zh": "星井和四条，算是有段时间没见了吧？\n不过我听说了不少传闻。看来你们表现得很活跃嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "053bbcc54ae9ad2ed06bf554574fd6b29138760359e301419ab2d367d00e9f95", "ja": "ミキ、そこそこ頑張ってるから。あはっ☆", "zh": "美希最近也在努力呢。啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "af3b1889ffcde2508366d88cb3d888a5c518aa9d8727f66e3f77e7244badad02", "ja": "ご無沙汰しています。こちらに戻っていたのですね。\n貴方もここでレッスンを？", "zh": "好久不见。原来你已经回到这里了。\n你也要在这里训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1014_202xxx", "source_sha256": "eaae34c50f47f878e9115f89a2157ef70ed91f714a835f6c4721611ac08a79b7", "ja": "うん、『アーク』とやらには誘われていてね。\nそれに、ここはいろいろ整ってるみたいだから。", "zh": "嗯，有人邀请我加入那个叫什么“方舟”的计划。\n而且，这里看起来各种设施都很齐备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1015_202xxx", "source_sha256": "a5e0f2fe1d671b8cfe2e1f5325d81db1b3192ec5ffc3b5fd897e29b4d61b6bdb", "ja": "そんなことより君たちこそ。\nあ、もしかして、961プロに移籍でもしたの？", "zh": "比起那个，倒是你们才是吧。啊，难不成你们跳槽到961事务所了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "8282f57f4d75c6d208a80fb6c4e714b6a2f570eaeabd7f2b109ed4ad67217dcf", "ja": "するわけないでしょ！　自分達はフェスに出るだけ！\n961プロは、自分たちのライバルだからね！", "zh": "怎么可能啊！我们只是参加庆典而已！\n961事务所可是我们的对手呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "15d8dcd0429ae2b4d3ac3fc10ea8ea328775189c3c5eb605eb67b657a558aeac", "ja": "あ、もちろん玲音と詩花は、敵とかじゃないけど……\nでも黒井社長は敵なんだ！", "zh": "啊，当然，玲音和诗花并不是敌人……\n但是黑井社长是敌人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1018_202xxx", "source_sha256": "5deb42649af289227dbe3e811810edb4fb92c3c9297baf48da0793e9bb994bc6", "ja": "はは、だいぶ嫌ってそうだね。君たちは、\n黒井社長をどういう人だと思ってるんだい？", "zh": "哈哈，看起来你们相当讨厌他呢。你们觉得黑井社长是个什么样的人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "dd2e36804cfc0d4b7871da77453e3888bd77f8695485fecbe896723fec8d3d41", "ja": "黒いおじさん。\nいっつも人差し指立ててるの。", "zh": "那个黑黑的大叔。总是竖着食指。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "c9ca4d1098437acd8a0946724f74a27607f74f304e17def11b82d95de9cf335c", "ja": "目的のためには手段を選ばぬ御仁かと。", "zh": "我觉得那位是不择手段也要达成目的的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "3119bb2c5dcafaeb5fc007e01f51325fb520b064969000550389d75a73a4446f", "ja": "あと、ヒドイことばっかり言うよね！\n仲間はいらないとか、くだらないとか……、", "zh": "而且，你总是说些很过分的话！\n什么“不需要伙伴”啦、“无聊透顶”啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "6ee6b096e98c39a69cf97546ebef158e5051a1c974258cffd8415784ce15fc3c", "ja": "圧倒的な力でライバルをねじふせて、\n二度と立ち上がれないくらい、やっつけてやる、とか！", "zh": "用压倒性的力量压制对手，\n狠狠地击溃他们，让他们再也站不起来之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1023_202xxx", "source_sha256": "4c6f7d4db5134bb7e32602e1355f16a61accdbd9c3a6c37dd25574b4a41f5332", "ja": "へえ、それはそれで格好いいんじゃない？\n自信のある証拠だし、必ず勝つという覚悟でもある。", "zh": "诶，那样也挺帅的，不是吗？\n这既是自信的证明，也是下定决心一定要赢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "4dcb2180fa18a76db34123b862c51f2dca9d348a50043120ac1f8c344c038774", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そうかな？　そっか……。\nじゃあそれは置いとくけど、他はヒドイでしょ！？", "zh": "诶？这、这样吗？原来如此……  \n那这个先放一边不说，其他的很过分吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "f0e827e48fd322c63e16d25ce9fd6b003047ae11992b4f3307bab715e9a1e526", "ja": "自分、どうして玲音たちが961プロにいるのか、\n不思議なくらいさー。", "zh": "我都觉得奇怪了，玲音她们怎么会在961制作人手下啊——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1026_202xxx", "source_sha256": "31a0a1844694af9c0fe5c4bf8a791c9607086ed75106c6bba3fa7c43579c03e1", "ja": "あははっ、まあ口は悪いよね！　慈悲深くもない。\n実際手段も選ばないし、嫌われることも厭わない。", "zh": "啊哈哈，确实挺毒舌的！也没什么慈悲心。\n实际上还不择手段，也不在乎被人讨厌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1027_202xxx", "source_sha256": "871dd69b3ee679d505116318bd3370ccb5ff22bdf8ac726a02a1d8007eb925b1", "ja": "でも、それは本当におかしなことかな？", "zh": "但是，这真的很奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1029_202xxx", "source_sha256": "908f073ee00f4c9360d298e35217b805337af98b7b63d42b10b51f63fb575156", "ja": "トップアイドルを作る人間として。\n世界を席巻するようなムーブメントの仕掛け人として。", "zh": "作为打造顶尖偶像的人。\n作为掀起席卷全世界潮流的幕后推手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1030_202xxx", "source_sha256": "55f4cff30c89ec222f3c901b3238661e1eb739ce34c9be4d9ffedac804455da8", "ja": "アタシは彼に不足があるとは思ってないよ。間違って\nいるとも思わない。だからサポートを受けている。", "zh": "我不觉得他有什么不足。也不认为他做错了。所以我才会接受他的支持。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1031_008tak", "source_sha256": "90b8083714c1e1a51d51ef59ba4928cc3fcc9d6dceca870c7d6a4f56a7ba7f81", "ja": "玲音……仰りたいことはわかる気がいたします。\n貴女のように強い方なら、なおさらのこと。", "zh": "玲音……我想我能理解您想说的话。\n像您这样强大的人，更是如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1032_008tak", "source_sha256": "cdcf4bd4abbec4df798c20aadbf456e6d91774fd273ca7ff115a547069ea76db", "ja": "ですが人は様々です。いたずらに敵を作り、\n人との繋がりを断つことは、自ら孤独を選ぶ道。", "zh": "但每个人都不一样。无端树敌、切断与他人的联系，无异于选择了孤独的道路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1033_008tak", "source_sha256": "ba6d5b3a14320f46dfb9c5fb95e8b5128b0997a18d5f143c93cdd9140f970f41", "ja": "孤独で、孤高であろうとすることは……\nあまりに寂しくはありませんか？", "zh": "甘于孤独、一心求孤高……\n未免也太过寂寞了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1034_202xxx", "source_sha256": "e81f2b3be06067b3612a03d97e4df540c6452e54f7e21451e86f4bb1e611d339", "ja": "そんなの、寂しいに決まってるじゃないか。", "zh": "那种事，当然会感到寂寞啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1035_008tak", "source_sha256": "d2f3e04ec5e87474dc858b6e01ca36c81f317d19850933ddfce03a3132eae376", "ja": "え……。玲音？", "zh": "诶……玲音？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1036_202xxx", "source_sha256": "c0ccd5e0932d9a2824f33bf66fdc66c31433f4c922f827b45164f4a4a23405a8", "ja": "でも、頂点はただひとつ。トップアイドルとは\n本来そういうモノ。これも一面の真実だ。", "zh": "但是，顶点只有一个。所谓顶尖偶像，本来就是这样的存在。这也是事实的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1037_202xxx", "source_sha256": "8da31978516f7b1eec8952fe87cfb5dee59e58c949fd21241e2b4f73c6d99a5f", "ja": "だからアタシは全速力で走り続ける。そんな孤高の存在\nになるために、周りに誰かがいても、いなくても。", "zh": "所以，我会继续全速奔跑。为了成为那样孤高的存在，\n无论身边有没有人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1038_202xxx", "source_sha256": "cb1cf26d9c4a36f9830127ae79ce2092f9ba0b814188cffbd103372682329aa2", "ja": "今は詩花がいるし、我那覇も四条も、星井もいる。\n劇場のみんなもね。だから全然寂しくないよ？", "zh": "现在有诗花在，还有我那霸、四条和星井。剧场里的大家也都在。所以我一点也不寂寞哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1039_202xxx", "source_sha256": "e58721f6c9aaa92f31734393c027d7b4bc1c49caf8f9dd89c1a22cfd88590f1e", "ja": "でも寂しくならないことは、アタシの目標じゃない。\n間違いなく黒井にとってもね。", "zh": "不过，不感到寂寞并不是我的目标。\n对黑井来说，肯定也是一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1041_202xxx", "source_sha256": "d808c31bdd141ab693431135778ba6d5a473157a6aee55265305a641e178a058", "ja": "まぁ、ここでの経験はきっと君たちの力になる。\nだから本当に、期待してるよ！", "zh": "不过，这里的经验一定会化为你们的力量。\n所以我真的很期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1042_013hib", "source_sha256": "229bfd234e22006b6cc51d8f022f534e05f2d2fcae8c6bc97f4832b0b1df32bb", "ja": "あ。……もちろんだぞっ！　絶対、玲音がビックリする\nステージを見せてあげるからね！", "zh": "啊……当然啦！绝对会让玲音大吃一惊的舞台，就演给她看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "08dc020768cb85c7b9bbccff6ff130519d1c6b63dd441faf6384e392cd92076e", "ja": "（玲音は、確かに961プロの理想を体現している\nアイドルのひとりだ。それは間違いない）", "zh": "（玲音确实是体现了961制作人理想的偶像之一。这一点毋庸置疑）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_03_1044_p", "source_sha256": "9aaa81b0037619027c75434f8c648e758e5ce03f0546d7373f3dc144888291a9", "ja": "（トップアイドルは孤高の存在。もちろん、\n考えたことがなかったわけではないけど……）", "zh": "（顶级偶像是孤高的存在。当然，也不是从来没想过这一点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
